steps:
Add this site to the Caddyfile, put the hash in place of HASH, then reload Caddy.
:2020 {
basic_auth {
dumbmonit HASH
}
@readonly {
method GET
path /config/apps/http/servers /reverse_proxy/upstreams /metrics
}
handle @readonly {
reverse_proxy localhost:2019 {
header_up Host localhost:2019
}
}
respond 403
}

Add this location to the server block Nginx already serves, restricted to the DumbMonit host (adjust the address).
location /basic_status {
stub_status;
allow 10.0.0.5;
deny all;
}
